<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Altaycon — Concreting & Construction, Greenvale VIC</title>
<meta name="description" content="Altaycon — concrete contracting, surfacing, structural concreting and site excavation in Greenvale VIC."/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;700;900&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;700;900&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;700;900&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"></noscript>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/favicon.png"/>
<meta property="og:title" content="Altaycon — Concreting & Construction"/>
<meta property="og:description" content="Concrete contracting, surfacing, structural concreting and site excavation in Greenvale VIC."/>
<meta property="og:image" content="assets/logo.png"/>
<meta property="og:type" content="website"/>
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#101114;
  --mist:#f0f0f0;
  --hairline:#d8d8d8;
  --accent:#000000;
  --bg:var(--mist);
  --line:var(--hairline);
  --canvas-bg:#ffffff;
}
*, *::before, *::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html{scroll-behavior:auto}
  .rv{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
  canvas{transition:none!important}
}
body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:"Public Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;
  font-size:clamp(1rem,0.95rem+0.25vw,1.125rem);
  line-height:1.65;
  color:var(--ink);
  background:var(--bg);
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
}
.js .rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity 700ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1),transform 700ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)}
.js .rv.on{opacity:1;transform:none}
img{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:2px}
.skip-link{position:absolute;top:-100%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:0.75rem 1.25rem;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-weight:600;z-index:1000;border-radius:0 0 6px 6px}
.skip-link:focus{top:0}
header{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;
  background:rgba(240,240,240,0.92);
  backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(8px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline);
}
.header-inner{
  max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:1rem 1.5rem;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;
}
.logo-mark{width:40px;height:40px;flex-shrink:0}
.logo-mark svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
.site-title{
  font-family:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif;
  font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(1.125rem,1rem+0.5vw,1.375rem);
  letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.1;color:var(--ink);
}
nav ul{display:flex;gap:2rem;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
nav a{
  font-family:"Public Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;
  font-weight:500;font-size:0.875rem;letter-spacing:0.02em;
  color:var(--ink);opacity:0.7;
  transition:opacity 200ms ease;
}
nav a:hover,nav a:focus{opacity:1}
.cta-btn{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;
  padding:0.625rem 1.25rem;
  font-family:"Public Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;
  font-weight:600;font-size:0.875rem;letter-spacing:0.02em;
  color:#fff;background:var(--ink);
  border:0;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;
  transition:background 200ms ease,transform 150ms ease;
}
.cta-btn:hover{background:#1a1a1a;transform:translateY(-1px)}
.cta-btn:active{transform:translateY(0)}
.cta-btn svg{width:18px;height:18px}
main{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem}
section{padding:clamp(3rem,5vw+1rem,5rem) 0}
.section-inner{width:100%}
h1{
  font-family:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif;
  font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,2rem+3vw,4rem);
  line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0 0 1rem;color:var(--ink);
}
h2{
  font-family:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif;
  font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,1.25rem+1vw,2rem);
  line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 0.75rem;color:var(--ink);
}
h3{
  font-family:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif;
  font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.125rem,1rem+0.5vw,1.375rem);
  line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 0.5rem;color:var(--ink);
}
p{margin:0 0 1rem;color:var(--ink);opacity:0.85}
p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.lead{font-size:clamp(1.125rem,1rem+0.5vw,1.25rem);font-weight:500;opacity:0.9;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.hero{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);align-items:center;
  padding-top:clamp(3rem,5vw,4rem);padding-bottom:clamp(3rem,5vw,4rem);
}
@media (min-width:900px){
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr}
}
.hero-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
.hero-canvas-wrap{
  position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:var(--canvas-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;
}
.hero-canvas-wrap canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}
.hero-cta{margin-top:1.5rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cta-secondary{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;
  padding:0.625rem 1.25rem;
  font-family:"Public Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;
  font-weight:600;font-size:0.875rem;letter-spacing:0.02em;
  color:var(--ink);background:transparent;
  border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;
  transition:border-color 200ms ease,background 200ms ease;
}
.cta-secondary:hover{border-color:var(--ink);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.03)}
.service-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.5rem;
}
@media (min-width:640px){
  .service-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}
@media (min-width:1000px){
  .service-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
}
.service-card{
  background:var(--canvas-bg);border:1px solid var(--hairline);
  border-radius:8px;padding:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  transition:border-color 200ms ease,box-shadow 200ms ease;
}
.service-card:hover{border-color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(16,17,20,0.06)}
.service-card h3{margin-bottom:0.5rem}
.service-card p{font-size:0.9375rem;line-height:1.6;opacity:0.8}
.process-band{
  background:var(--canvas-bg);border:1px solid var(--hairline);
  border-radius:8px;padding:clamp(2rem,3vw,3rem);
}
.process-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.5rem}
@media (min-width:720px){
  .process-steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}
@media (min-width:1000px){
  .process-steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
}
.process-step{position:relative;padding-left:2rem}
.process-step::before{
  content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.25rem;
  width:0.5rem;height:1.5rem;background:var(--ink);
  border-radius:2px;
}
.process-step h3{margin-bottom:0.25rem}
.process-step p{font-size:0.9375rem;opacity:0.8;margin:0}
.locality-band{
  background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;
  padding:clamp(2rem,3vw,3rem);text-align:center;
}
.locality-band h2{color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.5rem}
.locality-band p{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);margin:0;font-size:1.125rem}
footer{
  background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:clamp(3rem,5vw,4rem) 1.5rem;
  margin-top:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);
}
.footer-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}
@media (min-width:720px){
  .footer-inner{grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr}
}
.footer-brand .logo-mark{width:48px;height:48px;margin-bottom:1rem}
.footer-brand p{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);font-size:0.9375rem;margin:0}
.footer-nav h3,.footer-contact h3{
  font-family:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif;
  font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;letter-spacing:0.05em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;margin:0 0 1rem;
}
.footer-nav ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem}
.footer-nav a{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);transition:color 200ms ease}
.footer-nav a:hover{color:#fff}
.footer-contact p{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin:0 0 0.5rem;font-size:0.9375rem}
.footer-contact a{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);transition:color 200ms ease}
.footer-contact a:hover{color:#fff}
.footer-bottom{
  max-width:1200px;margin:2rem auto 0;padding-top:1.5rem;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;align-items:center;text-align:center;
}
@media (min-width:640px){
  .footer-bottom{flex-direction:row;justify-content:space-between;text-align:left}
}
.footer-legal{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.5rem;justify-content:center}
@media (min-width:640px){.footer-legal{justify-content:flex-start}}
.footer-legal a{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);font-size:0.8125rem;transition:color 200ms ease}
.footer-legal a:hover{color:#fff}
.footer-socials{display:flex;gap:1rem}
.footer-socials a{
  width:40px;height:40px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  transition:border-color 200ms ease,background 200ms ease;
}
.footer-socials a:hover{border-color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1)}
.footer-socials svg{width:20px;height:20px}
.legal-section{
  max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1.5rem 3rem;
  border-top:1px solid var(--hairline);
}
.legal-section h2{font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
.legal-section p{font-size:0.9375rem;color:var(--ink);opacity:0.8}
.legal-section h3{font-size:1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem}
@media (max-width:599px){
  .header-inner{flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;text-align:center}
  nav ul{order:3;width:100%;justify-content:center;margin-top:1rem}
  .cta-btn{order:4}
}
</style>
<style id="lb-motion-css">
/* ==== LB MOTION PACK ==== */
.lb-rb,.lb-rb *,.lb-mq,.lb-mq *{box-sizing:border-box}
/* A header must never be hidden by a scroll-reveal state: the nav/brand is chrome, not
   content. Unrevealed .rv wrappers left whole headers at opacity:0 (invisible logo). */
header, .site-header, .page-header, nav.nav, .nav .rv, nav.rv, .header-inner, .nav-inner,
header .rv, .site-header .rv, .nav-inner .rv{
  opacity:1 !important; visibility:visible !important; transform:none !important;
}
.lb-rb{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#0c0d10}
.lb-mq{max-width:100%;overflow:hidden}
.lb-rb__track{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/7}
.lb-rb__slide{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;transition:opacity .9s ease;will-change:opacity}
.lb-rb__slide.is-on{opacity:1}
.lb-rb__slide img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transform:scale(1.03);transition:transform 7s linear}
.lb-rb__slide.is-on img{transform:scale(1.10)}
.lb-rb__cap{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:clamp(14px,2.2vw,30px);
 background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(6,7,10,.72));color:#fff;
 font-family:var(--lb-sub,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;
 font-size:clamp(9px,1vw,13px);z-index:2}
.lb-rb__dots{position:absolute;top:50%;right:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px);transform:translateY(-50%);
 display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;z-index:3}
.lb-rb__dots button{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);
 background:transparent;cursor:pointer;padding:0;transition:transform .25s,background .25s}
.lb-rb__dots button.is-on{background:#fff;transform:scale(1.35)}
.lb-rb__nav{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:3;width:44px;height:44px;
 border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);background:rgba(8,9,12,.35);color:#fff;
 cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:17px;line-height:1;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
 transition:background .25s,transform .25s}
.lb-rb__nav:hover{background:rgba(8,9,12,.7)}
.lb-rb__nav--prev{left:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px)}
.lb-rb__nav--next{right:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px)}
.lb-rb__nav:active{transform:translateY(-50%) scale(.92)}
@media (max-width:700px){.lb-rb__track{aspect-ratio:4/3}.lb-rb__nav{width:36px;height:36px}}

a.btn,.btn,button.btn,.nav-cta a,.wp-block-button__link{position:relative;overflow:hidden;
 transition:transform .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1),box-shadow .22s,filter .22s}
a.btn:hover,.btn:hover,button.btn:hover,.nav-cta a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);
 box-shadow:0 10px 24px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.55);filter:brightness(1.05)}
a.btn:active,.btn:active,button.btn:active,.nav-cta a:active{transform:translateY(0) scale(.985)}
a.btn::after,.btn::after,.nav-cta a::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:38%;
 left:-60%;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.32),transparent);
 transform:skewX(-18deg);transition:left .55s ease;pointer-events:none}
a.btn:hover::after,.btn:hover::after,.nav-cta a:hover::after{left:130%}

.lb-rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1)}
.lb-rv.is-in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
 .lb-rv{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
 .lb-rb__slide img{transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
 a.btn::after,.btn::after,.nav-cta a::after{display:none}
}

/* marquee band (professional, reference-derived) */
.lb-mq{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#0b0c10;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
 border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10)}
.lb-mq__in{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:lb-mq 34s linear infinite}
.lb-mq:hover .lb-mq__in{animation-play-state:paused}
.lb-mq__in span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(18px,3vw,44px);
 padding:clamp(11px,1.5vw,19px) clamp(14px,2vw,26px);color:#fff;font-family:var(--lb-disp,Inter),sans-serif;
 font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:clamp(11px,1.25vw,17px);white-space:nowrap}
.lb-mq__in span i{font-style:normal;color:var(--lb-acc,#e51924)}
@keyframes lb-mq{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.lb-mq__in{animation:none}}
</style>
<style id="lb-hero-css">
canvas.lb-hero-canvas{position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block; z-index:0; pointer-events:none}
canvas#heroCanvas, canvas.hero-canvas, canvas.lb3d-canvas{
  position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block; z-index:0;
}
</style>
</head>
<body><a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
<header role="banner">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a href="/" class="logo-mark" aria-label="Altaycon home">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <title>Altaycon logo</title>
        <path d="M58 192 L58 56 C58 50.5 62.5 46 68 46 L72 46 C77.5 46 82 50.5 82 56 L82 192 C82 197.5 77.5 202 72 202 L68 202 C62.5 202 58 197.5 58 192 Z" fill="#000000"/>
        <path d="M174 192 L174 56 C174 50.5 178.5 46 184 46 L188 46 C193.5 46 198 50.5 198 56 L198 192 C198 197.5 193.5 202 188 202 L184 202 C178.5 202 174 197.5 174 192 Z" fill="#000000"/>
        <path d="M56 140 C88 140 104 124 128 124 C152 124 168 140 200 140 L200 164 C168 164 152 148 128 148 C104 148 88 164 56 164 Z" fill="#0a0a0a"/>
        <path d="M56 140 C72 108 88 92 128 92 L128 116 C88 116 72 132 56 164 Z" fill="#050505"/>
        <path d="M128 92 C168 92 184 108 200 140 L200 164 C184 132 168 116 128 116 Z" fill="#050505"/>
        <path d="M112 88 L144 88 C144 82 148.5 78 154 78 L154 74 C148.5 74 144 70 144 64 L112 64 C106.5 70 102 74 102 78 L102 78 C96.5 78 92 82 92 88 L112 88 Z" fill="#000000"/>
        <path d="M124 116 L124 140 C124 142.2 125.8 144 128 144 C130.2 144 132 142.2 132 140 L132 116 C132 113.8 130.2 112 128 112 C125.8 112 124 113.8 124 116 Z" fill="#000000"/>
        <path d="M112 82 L144 82 C144 79 146 77 148 77 L148 75 C146 75 144 73 144 70 L112 70 C106.5 73 104 75 104 77 L104 77 C102 77 100 79 100 82 L112 82 Z" fill="#1a1a1a" opacity="0.5"/>
      </svg>
      <img src="assets/logo.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none"/>
    </a>
    <div class="site-title">Altaycon</div>
    <nav role="navigation" aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="#process">Approach</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <a href="#contact" class="cta-btn" aria-label="Request a quote">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      Get a quote
    </a>
  </div>
</header>
<main id="main" role="main">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1 id="hero-title" class="rv">Altaycon</h1>
      <p class="lead rv" style="transition-delay:80ms">Concrete contracting, surfacing, structural concreting and site excavation in Greenvale VIC.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#contact" class="cta-btn rv" style="transition-delay:160ms">Request a quote</a>
        <a href="#services" class="cta-secondary rv" style="transition-delay:240ms">View services</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-canvas-wrap rv" style="transition-delay:120ms" aria-hidden="true">
      <canvas id="detail-canvas" aria-label="Pour ribbon detail — a continuous concrete ribbon band in perspective with screed bar and formwork edges"></canvas>
    </div>
  </section><section id="services" class="rv" aria-labelledby="services-title" style="transition-delay:80ms">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 id="services-title">Services</h2>
      <div class="service-grid">
        <article class="service-card rv">
          <h3>Concrete Contracting</h3>
          <p>Formwork, placement and finishing for residential and commercial concrete works.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card rv" style="transition-delay:40ms">
          <h3>Surfacing & Finishes</h3>
          <p>Exposed aggregate, polished, broom and trowel finishes for driveways, paths and slabs.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card rv" style="transition-delay:80ms">
          <h3>Structural Concreting</h3>
          <p>Footings, beams, columns, suspended slabs and retaining walls to engineering spec.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card rv" style="transition-delay:120ms">
          <h3>Site Excavation</h3>
          <p>Cut and fill, site leveling, trench excavation and subgrade preparation.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="process" class="process-band rv" aria-labelledby="process-title" style="transition-delay:120ms">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 id="process-title">Our Approach</h2>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step rv">
          <h3>Plan & Set Out</h3>
          <p>Review drawings, confirm levels and establish grid lines before any pour.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step rv" style="transition-delay:40ms">
          <h3>Form & Reinforce</h3>
          <p>Erect formwork to tolerance, place reinforcement and install embeds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step rv" style="transition-delay:80ms">
          <h3>Place & Screed</h3>
          <p>Continuous pour, vibration and screed to specified finish level.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step rv" style="transition-delay:120ms">
          <h3>Cure & Hand Over</h3>
          <p>Apply curing regime, saw-cut control joints and certify compliance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="contact" class="locality-band rv" aria-labelledby="contact-title" style="transition-delay:160ms">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 id="contact-title">Greenvale VIC</h2>
      <p><a href="tel:+61452658485">0452658485</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
