</footer><section id="privacy" class="legal-section rv" aria-labelledby="privacy-title" style="transition-delay:80ms">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2 id="privacy-title">Privacy</h2>
    <p>We collect only the information you voluntarily provide when you submit a quote request: name, contact details and project description. This data is used solely to respond to your enquiry and is not sold or shared with third parties for marketing. You may request access to or deletion of your data at any time by contacting us.</p>
    <h3>Data retention</h3>
    <p>Enquiry records are retained for 12 months unless a longer period is required by law.</p>
    <h3>Cookies</h3>
    <p>This site uses no analytics or advertising cookies. Only essential session cookies may be set by the quote form endpoint.</p>
  </div>
